    "history_en": "Eslite Xinyi closed on Christmas Eve 2023, after 18 years, because its lease with landlord Uni-President Group ran out. On the last day the building was packed and staff set up queue lines to keep people moving through the shelves; public television quoted chairperson Wu Min-chieh on the memories visitors had left there. The lights went out at 10:30 p.m. A report says more than 75,000 people came on the day before. The store had been Taipei's only all-night bookstore since 2020, and that role moved to the Songshan Cultural and Creative Park branch in January 2024.",
